# Denali operator-smoke wizard template bootstrap

## Problem

`devBootstrap.wizardTemplate` on Denali seeded only tenant `…000003` (`denali.localhost` /
`DENALI_SMOKE_TENANT_ID`). Operator admin smoke and Phase 9/P6 hosts use tenant
`…000014` (`operator.admin.localhost`, `OPERATOR_SMOKE_TENANT_ID`).

That tenant already appears in `devBootstrap.pluginTenantIds` (plugin resolution works),
but **not** in `wizardTemplate.tenantIds`. On `STORAGE_DRIVER=memory` / fresh API boot,
`bootstrapWorkspaceWizardTemplatesIfNeeded()` therefore never writes a published
`wizard_template` for `…014`.

Symptom: `apps/web` `/tours/new` shows the intentional **not-configured** gate
(`create-tour-wizard-chrome` → `notConfigured.*`) even though Denali plugin loads.

Urban already solved the same class of gap in P15-P-D0 — extend the **same** manifest →
codegen → bootstrap loop. Do **not** add a parallel seed module, Playwright-only PUT as
“fix”, or workspace-id branches in apps.

## Decision

| Layer | Change |
| ----- | ------ |
| Manifest | `packages/workspaces/denali/workspace.manifest.json` → `devBootstrap.wizardTemplate.tenantIds` includes **both** `…003` and `…014` |
| Codegen | `pnpm run generate:workspace-registry` → `WORKSPACE_DEV_WIZARD_TEMPLATE_BINDINGS` |
| Runtime | Existing `bootstrapWorkspaceWizardTemplatesIfNeeded()` / `seedWorkspaceWizardTemplate()` — no new boot path |
| Product gate | Keep not-configured empty state when template is unpublished (correct tenant SoT) |

## Source of truth

| Layer | Module | Responsibility |
| ----- | ------ | -------------- |
| Manifest | `denali` `devBootstrap.wizardTemplate` | Tenant UUID allowlist + `buildExport` |
| Package | `buildDenaliTenantWizardTemplatePayload()` | Full published steps (`denali_basic` … `denali_legal`; host chrome owns `review`) |
| Generated | `workspace-dev-bootstrap-bindings.generated.ts` | Binding consumed by API |
| API | `seed-workspace-wizard-template.ts` | Idempotent `settings_config` row (`configKey: wizard_template`) |
| API boot | `bootstrap-workspace-wizard-templates.ts` | Non-production listen warm |

## Idempotency

Same as Urban/Denali seed: skip when existing payload is `published: true` and
`steps.length >= minPublishedSteps` (Denali: `2`).

## Verify

```bash
pnpm run generate:workspace-registry
pnpm run guard:workspace-registry-fresh
pnpm --filter @apps/api exec node --import tsx --test test/seed-denali-operator-smoke-wizard-template.spec.ts
# Memory API boot + GET wizard_template as tenant …014 → published steps
# operator.admin.localhost:3000/tours/new → wizard shell (not notConfigured card)
```

## Non-goals

- Removing or softening the not-configured create-tour gate
- Hand-maintained template PUT inside E2E as the only bootstrap path
- Separate `bootstrap-operator-smoke-wizard-template.ts` file (use shared workspace bootstrap)
